0	Touma and Index enter a Virtual-On\ntournament in Academy City. As they\nbeat foe after foe, someone\nblocks their way.
1	Mikoto paired with Shokuhou over\nher, and Kuroko is livid. Mad with\njealous spite, her fangs strike\nentrants (mainly women).
2	Kaori Kanzaki comes to Academy City\nto solve a worldwide "problem," and\ncontacts a fellow magician:\nMotoharu Tsuchimikado.
3	Somewhere other than this world,\nthe "Magic God" meets a certain being.
4	Mikoto suspects a secret behind a\nVR tournament billed as drug\nresearch aid, and looks into it\nwith Shokuhou, who agrees.
5	"talken," Ririna's add-on, makes\nresource colors whiter. To find who\ncan evolve it, Saten and Uiharu\nhead into town.
6	Tangram tells of a world unlike\nthis one, "where Virtual-On exists."\nAsked by Othinus, it lets slip\nunexpected words.
7	Tsuchimikado probes the global\nproblem of too-accurate fortunes,\n"Definite Divination," asking\nIndex, a walking archive.
8	Index worries about Touma, on edge\nsince the Blue Stalker case. To keep\nhim out, she alone answers\nTsuchimikado and Kanzaki.
9	Beaten by Accelerator, escaped by\nFurashina, Mikoto and Uiharu regroup.\nAs they set out to warn others,\npursuers strike.
10	Secretly freed from the London\nTower, the Saint Acqua enters the\ncity, and tests whether Lessar is\n"the real thing" in a bout.
11	Lessar slips into Academy City with\nAcqua for a certain purpose. Touring\nthe city before they meet, whom\ndoes she run into?
12	Tangram, the Space-Time Causality\nControl System, rules every\npossibility. Against its power to\ngrant wishes, Othinus objects.
13	Ririn Furashina, "Second Plajiner,"\na girl Tangram's whims once ruled,\nchases her secret wish. Then a\ncertain person appears.
14	Misaki Shokuhou is caught in a riot\nfrom "talken" running amok. Worried\nfor Touma, she pushes through\nwith her Level 5 power.
15	Facing a berserk Ririn Furashina,\nAccelerator recalls his old self.\nStopping her, he senses another...\nthe one behind it all.
16	Tangram fears interference in its\nown world, where none can intrude.\nBut Othinus, ever objective, asks\nit a single question.
17	With strength borrowed from those\naround him, Touma storms alone into\nthe world where Tangram waits...\nto settle everything.
18	A citywide Virtual-On tournament,\nmade real by Ririn Furashina. To\nthe two who knew "the previous\nVirtual-On," it meant a lot.
19	"Wanna try proving your sexiness?"\nLured by that, Lessar finds a giant\nunderground arena. The tourney to\nmaster sexy begins!
20	Ignored by Mikoto for her ways,\nKuroko grows sicker each day.\nUnable to watch, Uiharu thinks up\nVirtual-On therapy for her.
21	With the Misaka Network, Last Order\nbuilds a mission she calls\nunclearable. Academy City's No. 1,\nAccelerator, just grins.
22	Saten and Uiharu enter a tourney\nwith the Explosion Code. They\ntrained hard for today, and seem\nto have something in mind...?
23	Touma and Index are called to the\n"Gigantes of the Ring," for the\ncity's strongest. Best team? Us\n(ore-tachi/watashi-tachi)!
